# Never in an image (audit-5 L1). COPY . . takes the build context whole, and
# config.py load_dotenv()s /app/.env at runtime: a local build would bake
# the hot wallet mnemonic, TUNNEL_TOKEN and AKASH_API_KEY into a layer, and
# the replay DB (passport nullifiers) with them.
# `**/` matches at any depth, the root included (audit-6 L5): a bare `*.db`
# or `.env*` matched only at the context root, so deploy/akash/.env or a
# nested *.db would have been copied in.
**/.env*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-journal
**/.venv
.git
.github
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/state/
